    "segmentation_data": "by simp [flatten, flattenSegment, segments, program]",
    "race_free": "by\n  refine ⟨finalState unitOps (fun _ _ => ()) (fun _ => some ()), rfl, ?_⟩\n  have htrace : (finalState unitOps (fun _ _ => ()) (fun _ => some ())).trace = traceData := by rfl\n  rw [htrace]\n  decide",
    "segment_equivalence": "by\n  intro input outside\n  rw [segmentation_data]\n  refine ⟨finalState ops input outside, rfl, ?_, rfl⟩\n  have htrace : (finalState ops input outside).trace = traceData := by rfl\n  rw [htrace]\n  decide"
